# GYSH client routing uses Cloudflare Pages default SPA mode (no root 404.html).
# /api/* is handled by Pages Functions via public/_routes.json.
#
# Missing hashed files under /assets/ return a real 404 via public/assets/404.html
# (subdirectory 404). Do NOT add a catch-all `/* /index.html 200` here — that
# rule overrides the assets 404 and can serve HTML for missing .css/.js, which
# browsers then cache and break the site.
#
# Do NOT add `/assets/* … 404` rewrite rules: Pages _redirects ignores non-3xx
# rewrite status codes.
